The root proposed compensating K_X plus the complete installed addition, resetting S=A union X through restored endpoint transpositions into one new pure-memory boundary ray, then synthesizing a packet while H0 acts on nonclock originals. This was an unproved suggestion, not evidence or a required outcome. The full prior single-port, routed, autonomous and compensated sources and their conclusions were exposed. The routed source remains provisional and under separate review; exact algebra is reused with explicit hypotheses. This is not a blind or independent reconstruction.

The new geometry uses the frozen single-port sites as its base. Its one memory ray is an alternative to the preceding routed packet's three newly supplied rays, not an unlisted addition to that layout. Every original nonclock factor remains; the only discarded object is none. Prior pure memories in the original nonclock inventory remain original factors. No preparation or recycling of the newly supplied independent memory is claimed.

Model and reasoning effort are inherited without overrides. No delegation, other-chat action, Git/PR/audit/axiom/prompt/lock/operational-checkpoint mutation is authorized. Writes are confined to this directory. Scope is joint readiness for the one accessible pair's three-component graph; neither saturated-site implementation nor a full program is claimed.
